sequenceDiagram
    actor Sales as "Sales"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Order as "orderService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Sales->>UI: Select assigned retailer and products
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/orders
    API->>Order: Create(request, actor)
    Order->>DB: Validate territory, retailer, products, price and MLOR version
    alt Online valid
        Order->>DB: Save order PendingApproval with server_received_at
        Order->>DB: Save immutable input snapshots
        API-->>-UI: DH code and PendingApproval
    else Invalid scope/condition
        API-->>UI: 400/403/409 error
    end
    Note over Order,DB: No batch selection, reservation, Held quantity or payment occurs here.


